Z||000000||brianp1fiero||07-27-2000||11:45 PM||||Hello to all in this great forum.  I have been hanging out now for a few days and just can't seem to get enough.  Every one is so helpful and friendly.  I found out how little I knew about these cars we all love.  I have a 1985 GT currently undergoing a V-8 swap.  I opted for the 345 hp 350 ZZ3 crate motor.  I am using an original Zumalt V-8 kit.  Also have installed Speedway brake upgrade, KYB shocks and struts with Eibach springs.  Looking forward to having some fun and kicking some major butt.  Also considering a Finale rebody kit.  Not really sure if I will.  Its hard to beat the original Fiero look.  Timeless.  Oh well, again Hello to everyone.  <P>Brian||||reg||1
